@ Star Coin hitbox (Tsuru's misc "Fix star coin hitbox"; https://github.com/Zenith-Team/Tsuru,
@ Zenith Team, MPL-2.0). StarCoin_ActiveColliderInfo (0x60C0C504, used by 0x605F43EC) is the
@ Wii U's box: offset (0, -3), half size (12, 15), shape 0 (rectangle) -- a box shifted down
@ from the coin. As Tsuru: a circle of radius 15 on the coin's centre.

StarCoinHitbox_offsetY:
    type:    data
    address: 0x00C0C508
    data:    00 00 00 00

StarCoinHitbox_sizeX:
    type:    data
    address: 0x00C0C50C
    data:    00 00 70 41

StarCoinHitbox_shape:
    type:    data
    address: 0x00C0C514
    data:    01 00 00 00
